  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_2056.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El local social del Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil, en la calle Ecce Homo, ha acogido la noche de este jueves la cena y la proyecci&oacute;n de la &uacute;ltima pel&iacute;cula del&nbsp;ciclo de cine franc&eacute;s, El chef, la receta de la felicidad (2012).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcliclecinefrancesateneu/img_2052.jpg\" alt=\"img_2052\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcliclecinefrancesateneu/img_2053.jpg\" alt=\"img_2053\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcliclecinefrancesateneu/img_2054.jpg\" alt=\"img_2054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcliclecinefrancesateneu/img_2055.jpg\" alt=\"img_2055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcliclecinefrancesateneu/img_2056.jpg\" alt=\"img_2056\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcliclecinefrancesateneu/img_2057.jpg\" alt=\"img_2057\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
